Depends: default-jre-headless (>= 2:1.17) | java17-runtime-headless, ffmpeg, libmediainfo0v5, openssl, xdg-user-dirs, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: kcm-ums
Suggests: dcraw, mplayer, vlc-bin
Description: Universal Media Server, a DLNA and UPnP media server
 Shares videos, music and pictures with TVs and other devices on the network,
 and transcodes what a device cannot play. Built from the upstream 15.9.0 tag,
 using the edition's FFmpeg and MediaInfo. It runs as the user service
 ums.service, which is off until switched on: systemctl --user enable --now ums
 .
 The first run shares Pictures, Music and Videos (xdg-user-dirs) and never the
 home folder. Web interface: http://localhost:9001
